(6286671, 930321, 43463, '<td valign="top">The idea holds much promise. Love the play on Carrot/Carat and the action that is akin to the action films where the heist plays a heavy role in moving the storyline. The idea is strong but the set-up needs a bit of help to boost this into the high above average category. First, I think that the white backdrop is way too stark and glaring - when you think about it most of the great movie heists where the thief is stealing the jewel takes place at night and it is dark. Not to mention that red pops better off of a black backdrop and looks richer in color tone. The typical color of a ducky being yellow would also pop visually on a black backdrop - understood this is the only ducky you could probably get so not a big factor in critique - but you would have had to use a spotlight on the ducky to make sure the purple did not disappear into the black backdrop. The other thing about the action is the duck is like a thief sliding down on the rope, but here he looks like he is being hanged by the neck. If you have a glue gun (easy to peal off the wax glue when done with shot) you could have simply glued the string to the bottom of the duck to make it look like it is ''holding it'' while sliding down - if not simple craft glue or even crazy glue would have done the trick. The ''diamond'' could be presented a bit stronger if you could stand it up (depending on the lights you might have even captured a lovely sparkle too). Hmmm, one suggestion: use three carrots glued to the diamond to prop it up like a tripod (and it will look it is showcased in a museum or such). Lastly a case or glass enclosure like they have around valuable gems would have made the presentation all the more stronger. Sometimes a hunt around the house yeilds something that could mimic the glass case sometimes not. Hmm, if I remember correctly craft stores have this simple plastic rectagular containers (about the size of that plastic cup) that are small for beads/rocks/pebbles/whatnot that costs less than $2.00. As I said before the wall of words:-) the idea is good it just needs a little more attention to make it excellent.</td>', 'The idea holds much promise. Love the play on Carrot/Carat and the action that is akin to the action films where the heist plays a heavy role in moving the storyline. The idea is strong but the set-up needs a bit of help to boost this into the high above average category. First, I think that the white backdrop is way too stark and glaring - when you think about it most of the great movie heists where the thief is stealing the jewel takes place at night and it is dark. Not to mention that red pops better off of a black backdrop and looks richer in color tone. The typical color of a ducky being yellow would also pop visually on a black backdrop - understood this is the only ducky you could probably get so not a big factor in critique - but you would have had to use a spotlight on the ducky to make sure the purple did not disappear into the black backdrop. The other thing about the action is the duck is like a thief sliding down on the rope, but here he looks like he is being hanged by the neck. If you have a glue gun (easy to peal off the wax glue when done with shot) you could have simply glued the string to the bottom of the duck to make it look like it is ''holding it'' while sliding down - if not simple craft glue or even crazy glue would have done the trick. The ''diamond'' could be presented a bit stronger if you could stand it up (depending on the lights you might have even captured a lovely sparkle too). Hmmm, one suggestion: use three carrots glued to the diamond to prop it up like a tripod (and it will look it is showcased in a museum or such). Lastly a case or glass enclosure like they have around valuable gems would have made the presentation all the more stronger. Sometimes a hunt around the house yeilds something that could mimic the glass case sometimes not. Hmm, if I remember correctly craft stores have this simple plastic rectagular containers (about the size of that plastic cup) that are small for beads/rocks/pebbles/whatnot that costs less than $2.00. As I said before the wall of words:-) the idea is good it just needs a little more attention to make it excellent.', '2011-01-18 08:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286672, 930331, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cute scene. Nice reflection. Great set.</td>', 'Cute scene. Nice reflection. Great set.', '2011-01-18 08:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286673, 930294, 108069, '<td valign="top">Quite funny and well done.</td>', 'Quite funny and well done.', '2011-01-18 08:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286676, 930245, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the idea of the caroler! Did a bit of a double take as that the cauliflower really took on the aspect of snow. Love the homemade string of ''holiday'' lights that complement the festive presentation in the photo. The backdrop plays well with the action in the scene for the hazy white makes me think of cold winter days in the city. I do have two small critiques, the first is that it would have been nice to have the full duck in view (bottom is cut/cropped out). Again not a big thing but just adds a little more completeness. Next, not sure about how well the title plays into the holiday festive scene - unless it is a subtle reference to Mr. Scrooge''s attitude.</td>', 'Love the idea of the caroler! Did a bit of a double take as that the cauliflower really took on the aspect of snow. Love the homemade string of ''holiday'' lights that complement the festive presentation in the photo. The backdrop plays well with the action in the scene for the hazy white makes me think of cold winter days in the city. I do have two small critiques, the first is that it would have been nice to have the full duck in view (bottom is cut/cropped out). Again not a big thing but just adds a little more completeness. Next, not sure about how well the title plays into the holiday festive scene - unless it is a subtle reference to Mr. Scrooge''s attitude.', '2011-01-18 09:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286686, 930291, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great balance! No, really - love how the subjects are balanced in the shot:-) The string divides the composition at a diagonal with the tightrope ducky on the top half and the spotlight in the bottom half. I get the strong sense of the ducky being a circus performer in the big top- well done in putting all the elements together. Love the creative way you included the vegetables in the shot - for tightrope walkers do balance objects as one thing in their act. Nicely done!</td>', 'Great balance! No, really - love how the subjects are balanced in the shot:-) The string divides the composition at a diagonal with the tightrope ducky on the top half and the spotlight in the bottom half. I get the strong sense of the ducky being a circus performer in the big top- well done in putting all the elements together. Love the creative way you included the vegetables in the shot - for tightrope walkers do balance objects as one thing in their act. Nicely done!', '2011-01-18 09:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286720, 929696, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wildly creative. Awesome job. Rock on.</td>', 'Wildly creative. Awesome job. Rock on.', '2011-01-18 09:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286722, 930358, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well done. Great composition.</td>', 'Well done. Great composition.', '2011-01-18 09:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286723, 930340, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice shallow DoF. Great scene.</td>', 'Nice shallow DoF. Great scene.', '2011-01-18 09:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286725, 929797, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the creativity here - great find on that tractor that fits the rubber ducky so perfectly! And love the attention to detail - that little hat says farmer big time! Celery and pumpkin (candies or toys as that I have seen both?) is the creative inclusion of vegetables. This is wonderfully creative! I do have one critique though...as much as I love the whole set-up (gave this an 8) I think it could be even stronger if the ground plane was potting soil or tilled earth rather than the stark white board showing through.</td>', 'Love the creativity here - great find on that tractor that fits the rubber ducky so perfectly! And love the attention to detail - that little hat says farmer big time! Celery and pumpkin (candies or toys as that I have seen both?) is the creative inclusion of vegetables. This is wonderfully creative! I do have one critique though...as much as I love the whole set-up (gave this an 8) I think it could be even stronger if the ground plane was potting soil or tilled earth rather than the stark white board showing through.', '2011-01-18 09:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286727, 929989, 108069, '<td valign="top">The logical flaws with this photo are nearly too much to overcome. Like a duck would need a boat? Or an umbrella for that matter? It''s absolutely preposterous. That said, it''s very well executed and a cute scene, and I was only kidding in the first place. Nice one.</td>', 'The logical flaws with this photo are nearly too much to overcome. Like a duck would need a boat? Or an umbrella for that matter? It''s absolutely preposterous. That said, it''s very well executed and a cute scene, and I was only kidding in the first place. Nice one.', '2011-01-18 09:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286729, 930188, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and excellent use of lighting. Great job.</td>', 'Nice composition and excellent use of lighting. Great job.', '2011-01-18 09:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286739, 930304, 108069, '<td valign="top">Going for the escape. Very cute. Nice one.</td>', 'Going for the escape. Very cute. Nice one.', '2011-01-18 10:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286774, 930337, 87808, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 4, here are the reasons I did that.  Your picture is very grainy, you did capture the fairy lights very well they are good, I am guessing a high ISO or long exposure, those are the main reasons for the yellow tint and grain  n You also have red hot spots in some areas that could have been cloned otu to make a better picture.  It is difficult to really see that your veggie is a red pepper, it is a cool idea though, but for sure you need more light on your subject.  At the bottom where you duck is sitting on the black cloth(?) it is almost too sharp of a line, as though it cut copied and pasted there, a little smoother and again lighting would have helped this.</td>', 'I gave this a 4, here are the reasons I did that.  Your picture is very grainy, you did capture the fairy lights very well they are good, I am guessing a high ISO or long exposure, those are the main reasons for the yellow tint and grain  n You also have red hot spots in some areas that could have been cloned otu to make a better picture.  It is difficult to really see that your veggie is a red pepper, it is a cool idea though, but for sure you need more light on your subject.  At the bottom where you duck is sitting on the black cloth(?) it is almost too sharp of a line, as though it cut copied and pasted there, a little smoother and again lighting would have helped this.', '2011-01-18 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286779, 930265, 87808, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 3, here are my reasons why.  I thin this is a great shot, I think it really makes a statement, I am not sure if this is in Australia or just a river bed, but to me, it shows loss. Unfortunelty, the challenge was very specific in what needed to be in the shots. I can only figure out one light source, I can not find the string or the vegetable, I can see sunglasses, coke cans and what almost looks like a  rotisserie chicken in the background. <br/> <br/>I do like this shot though, it is a statement.</td>', 'I gave this a 3, here are my reasons why.  I thin this is a great shot, I think it really makes a statement, I am not sure if this is in Australia or just a river bed, but to me, it shows loss. Unfortunelty, the challenge was very specific in what needed to be in the shots. I can only figure out one light source, I can not find the string or the vegetable, I can see sunglasses, coke cans and what almost looks like a  rotisserie chicken in the background.  I do like this shot though, it is a statement.', '2011-01-18 10:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286856, 930099, 69034, '<td valign="top">"You shall NOT PASS!"<br/>             -Duckdalf<br/> <br/>LOVE IT.  Brilliant idea.</td>', '"You shall NOT PASS!"             -Duckdalf LOVE IT.  Brilliant idea.', '2011-01-18 12:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286868, 930265, 69034, '<td valign="top">Where is the veggie?  I don''t see a veggie.</td>', 'Where is the veggie?  I don''t see a veggie.', '2011-01-18 12:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286898, 930265, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gives me pause to see such a cheery, coloful face in the mud and debris.  The string/rope and vegetable required are not apparent to me and it looks like there are additional duckies back there ... maybe in a net, which could be made of string, now that I think about it.  So not blatantly meeting the challenge to my eye, but an interesting image.</td>', 'Gives me pause to see such a cheery, coloful face in the mud and debris.  The string/rope and vegetable required are not apparent to me and it looks like there are additional duckies back there ... maybe in a net, which could be made of string, now that I think about it.  So not blatantly meeting the challenge to my eye, but an interesting image.', '2011-01-18 12:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286903, 930215, 65234, '<td valign="top">The part I like the best is the big, OOF eyeball ;-) Reflections are well done.  Rope seems like a random intrustion as it''s clearly not taut enough to be holding anything up or serving any useful purpose.  Overall a good effort, though.</td>', 'The part I like the best is the big, OOF eyeball ;-) Reflections are well done.  Rope seems like a random intrustion as it''s clearly not taut enough to be holding anything up or serving any useful purpose.  Overall a good effort, though.', '2011-01-18 12:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286906, 930344, 65234, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a warning that you shouldn''t step on a duck because its brains will come out, and they''re really vegetables?  ;-)  Fun image, if a bit macabre.</td>', 'Perhaps a warning that you shouldn''t step on a duck because its brains will come out, and they''re really vegetables?  ;-)  Fun image, if a bit macabre.', '2011-01-18 13:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286907, 930098, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute wing!  What a talented duckie :-)</td>', 'Cute wing!  What a talented duckie :-)', '2011-01-18 13:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286908, 930109, 65234, '<td valign="top">And that car even had eyes to see it was going to hit the poor duckie!  And he''s smiling about it, the sociopath.  Shame on him!!</td>', 'And that car even had eyes to see it was going to hit the poor duckie!  And he''s smiling about it, the sociopath.  Shame on him!!', '2011-01-18 13:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286914, 930260, 65234, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t have big, happy eyes like some duckies, and under the circumstances who can blame him?  I would think that sort of soup would be ... unpleasantly chewy ;-)</td>', 'He doesn''t have big, happy eyes like some duckies, and under the circumstances who can blame him?  I would think that sort of soup would be ... unpleasantly chewy ;-)', '2011-01-18 13:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286915, 930263, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ducky and the busses appear to be natives of different places.  Hope this was not some sort of immigrant rage episode =:-O  The scene might work better on a background looking more like either roads or sand IMO.</td>', 'Ducky and the busses appear to be natives of different places.  Hope this was not some sort of immigrant rage episode =:-O  The scene might work better on a background looking more like either roads or sand IMO.', '2011-01-18 13:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286916, 930245, 65234, '<td valign="top">Enough carolling, eh?  I can understand that :-)  Cauliflower makes for good snow and this is a nicely coherent scene.  Good work!</td>', 'Enough carolling, eh?  I can understand that :-)  Cauliflower makes for good snow and this is a nicely coherent scene.  Good work!', '2011-01-18 13:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286918, 930264, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is why I never enter those competitions at the county fair. It''s rigged, I say, rigged!</td>', 'This is why I never enter those competitions at the county fair. It''s rigged, I say, rigged!', '2011-01-18 13:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286919, 930246, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and you got all the required elements in.  I feel like the arrangement of ingredients could be better but I am hardly an expert on still life shots!  Focus/DOF look off to my eye.</td>', 'Interesting idea and you got all the required elements in.  I feel like the arrangement of ingredients could be better but I am hardly an expert on still life shots!  Focus/DOF look off to my eye.', '2011-01-18 13:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286922, 930366, 65234, '<td valign="top">Carved pumpkin is a clever idea for this challenge.  Could use a bit more light on the duck, and personally I would prefer an angle looking over the duck to the pumpkin, I think.  Not quite sure what the white thing with the pink circle is .. just doesn''t seem to belong in the scene.</td>', 'Carved pumpkin is a clever idea for this challenge.  Could use a bit more light on the duck, and personally I would prefer an angle looking over the duck to the pumpkin, I think.  Not quite sure what the white thing with the pink circle is .. just doesn''t seem to belong in the scene.', '2011-01-18 13:18:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6286923, 930295, 65234, '<td valign="top">He should consider putting wheels on that basket ;-)  Image looks a little soft on my screen.</td>', 'He should consider putting wheels on that basket ;-)  Image looks a little soft on my screen.', '2011-01-18 13:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286924, 930334, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ah, the classic tough guy. Is this Duck Wayne, or Clint Eastduck? Maybe it''s Duck Norris. Rats! NOW I start coming up with inspired ideas for this challenge!!! Grrrr...</td>', 'Ah, the classic tough guy. Is this Duck Wayne, or Clint Eastduck? Maybe it''s Duck Norris. Rats! NOW I start coming up with inspired ideas for this challenge!!! Grrrr...', '2011-01-18 13:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286925, 930291, 65234, '<td valign="top">Clever duckie!  And very coordinated, I might add.  I like all the red rays coming out of the light, too.  Nice work!</td>', 'Clever duckie!  And very coordinated, I might add.  I like all the red rays coming out of the light, too.  Nice work!', '2011-01-18 13:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286927, 930290, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a nasty little duckie!  Or, more kindly, a not-very-bright duckie ;-)</td>', 'What a nasty little duckie!  Or, more kindly, a not-very-bright duckie ;-)', '2011-01-18 13:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286928, 930358, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love it! What inspired lunacy!</td>', 'Love it! What inspired lunacy!', '2011-01-18 13:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286931, 930250, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gotta'' love Swedish Fish LOL!  Very well put-together scene.</td>', 'Gotta'' love Swedish Fish LOL!  Very well put-together scene.', '2011-01-18 13:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286933, 930261, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Excellent collection of props to tell this story :-)  And well shot.</td>', 'LOL!  Excellent collection of props to tell this story :-)  And well shot.', '2011-01-18 13:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286934, 930242, 65234, '<td valign="top">Is his beak actually burnt from that flame?!  Not the cleverest devil Ducky, is he?</td>', 'Is his beak actually burnt from that flame?!  Not the cleverest devil Ducky, is he?', '2011-01-18 13:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286935, 930243, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the broccoli trees.  Nice, simple scene, telling a story.</td>', 'Like the broccoli trees.  Nice, simple scene, telling a story.', '2011-01-18 13:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286937, 930099, 65234, '<td valign="top">I hope that flame doesn''t wilt that asparagus =:-o</td>', 'I hope that flame doesn''t wilt that asparagus =:-o', '2011-01-18 13:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286939, 930262, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sharp pepper ;-p  Gruesome, but not gory.  Maybe it''s the soft candlelight.  Kind of classy for a beheading LOL.</td>', 'Sharp pepper ;-p  Gruesome, but not gory.  Maybe it''s the soft candlelight.  Kind of classy for a beheading LOL.', '2011-01-18 13:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286940, 929705, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the ski gear :-)  Very clever.</td>', 'Love the ski gear :-)  Very clever.', '2011-01-18 13:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286943, 930188, 65234, '<td valign="top">And exactly how much pepper can he cut off and still get answers?  That seems like a no-win strategy for interrogation.</td>', 'And exactly how much pepper can he cut off and still get answers?  That seems like a no-win strategy for interrogation.', '2011-01-18 13:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286944, 930083, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Cute one.</td>', 'LOL!  Cute one.', '2011-01-18 13:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286945, 930359, 65234, '<td valign="top">I thought there was supposed to be a nice, safe net under a high wire .. er, rope?  Not much margin for error!</td>', 'I thought there was supposed to be a nice, safe net under a high wire .. er, rope?  Not much margin for error!', '2011-01-18 13:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286947, 930340, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like that headgear!</td>', 'Like that headgear!', '2011-01-18 13:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286948, 930086, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lucky Mrs. Ducky!  Is that an emergency exit rope or is there something lurking in her bathwater?</td>', 'Lucky Mrs. Ducky!  Is that an emergency exit rope or is there something lurking in her bathwater?', '2011-01-18 13:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286949, 929901, 65234, '<td valign="top">That had better be a wicked witch he has tied up and not poor, innocent Dorothy!</td>', 'That had better be a wicked witch he has tied up and not poor, innocent Dorothy!', '2011-01-18 13:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286952, 930192, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, what a cute little snake :-)</td>', 'Aw, what a cute little snake :-)', '2011-01-18 13:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286990, 930305, 108069, '<td valign="top">We just had a party this past weekend and we ended the night on what was a vegetable and what was not. It got heated. Really heated. I''m happy to say that because of the related research it''s determined that potatoes are indeed considered a vegetable, and I hope you don''t get crap for that. Great scene, though skiing at what looks like an island destination is odd. But what''s odd when a rubber ducky is skiing? Great job.</td>', 'We just had a party this past weekend and we ended the night on what was a vegetable and what was not. It got heated. Really heated. I''m happy to say that because of the related research it''s determined that potatoes are indeed considered a vegetable, and I hope you don''t get crap for that. Great scene, though skiing at what looks like an island destination is odd. But what''s odd when a rubber ducky is skiing? Great job.', '2011-01-18 14:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286992, 930173, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Cute scene. Ducky marathon winner. Nice job.</td>', 'Great lighting. Cute scene. Ducky marathon winner. Nice job.', '2011-01-18 14:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286996, 930337, 108069, '<td valign="top">Creative and tough to execute. Good job though. He looks like a lover and not a fighter though, with those hearts. Part of the disguise?</td>', 'Creative and tough to execute. Good job though. He looks like a lover and not a fighter though, with those hearts. Part of the disguise?', '2011-01-18 14:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6286997, 930321, 108069, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, but he sadly looks like he''s met his maker. Self inflicted. Colors are great though and it''s quite funny. I hope he pulls through.</td>', 'Creative idea, but he sadly looks like he''s met his maker. Self inflicted. Colors are great though and it''s quite funny. I hope he pulls through.', '2011-01-18 15:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6287005, 930071, 101702, '<td valign="top">Not the best shot for technicals, but an absolute winner for concept. I love Angry Birds (who doesn''t!) A 10 from me (the only one in the challenge).</td>', 'Not the best shot for technicals, but an absolute winner for concept. I love Angry Birds (who doesn''t!) A 10 from me (the only one in the challenge).', '2011-01-18 15:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6287011, 930209, 124815, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Dubious wine bottle for such a plump and brave duck! Vin de Canaris? 9</td>', 'Great idea. Dubious wine bottle for such a plump and brave duck! Vin de Canaris? 9', '2011-01-18 15:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6287018, 929705, 108069, '<td valign="top">Awesome job. Sure, he''s about to ski backwards off the peak, but he''s prepared, with his rope and radish helmet. Honestly a radish helmet might be the safest of all, as who the heck would eat them? Nice poles, great skis. Awesome job on this.</td>', 'Awesome job. Sure, he''s about to ski backwards off the peak, but he''s prepared, with his rope and radish helmet. Honestly a radish helmet might be the safest of all, as who the heck would eat them? Nice poles, great skis. Awesome job on this.', '2011-01-18 15:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6287019, 930265, 124982, '<td valign="top">Poor ducky looks like he''s having a hard life. Nice gritty photo, really do think it''s a great pic!</td>', 'Poor ducky looks like he''s having a hard life. Nice gritty photo, really do think it''s a great pic!', '2011-01-18 15:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6287022, 929901, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice. Ducky could be a tad sharper, though he has dipped into a bath and is on maybe his third drink, so maybe not all that sharp. The witch is dead, job is done. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice. Ducky could be a tad sharper, though he has dipped into a bath and is on maybe his third drink, so maybe not all that sharp. The witch is dead, job is done. Nice work.', '2011-01-18 15:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6287031, 930309, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is like a horrible vegetable/fake fowl pileup on the highway aqua blue. And yet no ambulance. I pray for him. And your score. Joke!</td>', 'This is like a horrible vegetable/fake fowl pileup on the highway aqua blue. And yet no ambulance. I pray for him. And your score. Joke!', '2011-01-18 15:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6287057, 930188, 20799, '<td valign="top">LOL! I love the expression on the paprika :)</td>', 'LOL! I love the expression on the paprika :)', '2011-01-18 16:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6287074, 930173, 117804, '<td valign="top">too bad for the shadow on the duck....</td>', 'too bad for the shadow on the duck....', '2011-01-18 16:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6287076, 929797, 117804, '<td valign="top">Really funny, I like the mini can...</td>', 'Really funny, I like the mini can...', '2011-01-18 16:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
