(6287968, 930109, 108069, '<td valign="top">Gutsy entry.<br/> <br/>Sorry. This is great. I especially like when home sets like this have a shallow depth of field. Great work.<br/> <br/>Edit: I don''t loke, I like. I like.</td>', 'Gutsy entry. Sorry. This is great. I especially like when home sets like this have a shallow depth of field. Great work. Edit: I don''t loke, I like. I like.', '2011-01-19 08:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
