(6293597, 930261, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by radarbrat:</b></div><hr/><i> Fantastic. What''s up with those low votes. Did these people feel threatened by this great image? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks! I sure would like an answer too, so that I can improve and don''t make the same mistake again.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-01-25 11:34:03.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by radarbrat: Fantastic. What''s up with those low votes. Did these people feel threatened by this great image?   Thanks! I sure would like an answer too, so that I can improve and don''t make the same mistake again.', '2011-01-25 11:33:50.000000', '2011-01-25 11:34:03.000000', 0),
(6293986, 930215, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MaryO:</b></div><hr/><i> The part I like the best is the big, OOF eyeball ;-) Reflections are well done.  Rope seems like a random intrustion as it''s clearly not taut enough to be holding anything up or serving any useful purpose.  Overall a good effort, though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree with you. Perhaps I made a few mistakes and many voters didn''t find all the elements in the picture... I will pay more attention next time  ^_-<br/> <br/>Thanks everybody.<br/> <br/>Ciao<br/>Alex</td>', 'Originally posted by MaryO: The part I like the best is the big, OOF eyeball ;-) Reflections are well done.  Rope seems like a random intrustion as it''s clearly not taut enough to be holding anything up or serving any useful purpose.  Overall a good effort, though.   I agree with you. Perhaps I made a few mistakes and many voters didn''t find all the elements in the picture... I will pay more attention next time  ^_- Thanks everybody. CiaoAlex', '2011-01-25 18:56:15.000000', NULL, 0),
